{"outcome":"component","existing":"","reason":"","code":"TextPhotoCarousel","label":"Text and photo carousel","description":"Two columns: a heading, a text and an optional button on one side, and on the other a row of photos with captions that the visitor scrolls sideways by hand. It snaps on each photo and never turns by itself, since there is no script. Use it to present a place, a workshop, a product or an event with several photos beside its text.","props":"[{"name": "title", "type": "text", "label": "Heading", "max": 120}, {"name": "text", "type": "html", "label": "Text"}, {"name": "button_label", "type": "text", "label": "Button text", "help": "Say where the button leads, for example: See our workshops.", "max": 80}, {"name": "button_url", "type": "url", "label": "Button link"}, {"name": "gallery_label", "type": "text", "label": "Name of the photo row", "help": "Read by screen readers to announce the row of photos, for example: Photos of the workshop.", "max": 120}, {"name": "photos_side", "type": "choice", "label": "Side of the photos", "choices": {"right": "Photos on the right", "left": "Photos on the left"}, "default": "right"}, {"name": "photos", "type": "items", "label": "Photos", "min": 1, "max": 12, "items": [{"name": "image", "type": "image", "label": "Photo", "required": true}, {"name": "alt", "type": "text", "label": "Alternative text", "help": "One sentence saying what the photo shows.", "max": 200}, {"name": "caption", "type": "text", "label": "Caption", "max": 200}]}]","sample":"{"title": "Notre atelier à Clermont-Ferrand", "text": "<p>Depuis 2012, nous fabriquons chaque pièce à la main, dans notre atelier du centre-ville.</p><p>Le cuir vient de tanneries françaises. Chaque sac est cousu, teint et contrôlé par la même artisane.</p>", "button_label": "Découvrir nos ateliers de création", "button_url": "/ateliers", "gallery_label": "Photos de l’atelier", "photos_side": "right", "photos": [{"image": null, "alt": "Une artisane coud la anse d’un sac en cuir sur un établi en bois.", "caption": "La couture d’une anse, point par point."}, {"image": null, "alt": "Des peaux de cuir fauve et noir empilées sur des étagères.", "caption": "Nos cuirs, tannés en France."}, {"image": null, "alt": "Des outils de maroquinerie alignés sur une table : poinçons, alênes et couteaux.", "caption": "Les outils de l’atelier."}, {"image": null, "alt": "La vitrine de la boutique, avec trois sacs exposés.", "caption": "La boutique, ouverte du mardi au samedi."}]}","template":"<section class="text-gallery text-gallery--photos-{{ props.photos_side|default('right') }}"><div class="text-gallery__content">{% if props.title is not empty %}<h2 class="text-gallery__title">{{ props.title }}</h2>{% endif %}{% if props.text is not empty %}<div class="text-gallery__body">{{ props.text }}</div>{% endif %}{% if props.button_label is not empty and props.button_url is not empty %}<a class="text-gallery__button" href="{{ props.button_url }}">{{ props.button_label }}</a>{% endif %}</div>{% if props.photos is not empty %}<div class="text-gallery__media"><ul class="text-gallery__photos" tabindex="0"{% if props.gallery_label is not empty %} aria-label="{{ props.gallery_label }}"{% endif %} data-cms-sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 42vw, 85vw">{% for photo in props.photos %}{% if photo.image %}<li class="text-gallery__photo"><figure class="text-gallery__figure"><img class="text-gallery__img" src="{{ photo.image }}" alt="{{ photo.alt|default('') }}" loading="lazy">{% if photo.caption is not empty %}<figcaption class="text-gallery__caption">{{ photo.caption }}</figcaption>{% endif %}</figure></li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</ul></div>{% endif %}</section>","css":".text-gallery { display: grid; gap: 2rem; align-items: center; }
.text-gallery__content { min-width: 0; }
.text-gallery__media { min-width: 0; }
.text-gallery__title { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: var(--cms-color-text); }
.text-gallery__body { color: var(--cms-color-text-muted); }
.text-gallery__button { display: inline-block; margin-top: 1.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 0.25rem; background-color: var(--cms-color-accent); color: var(--cms-color-on-accent); text-decoration: none; transition: background-color 0.2s ease; }
.text-gallery__button:hover { background-color: var(--cms-color-accent-strong); }
.text-gallery__button:focus-visible { background-color: var(--cms-color-accent-strong); outline: 2px solid var(--cms-color-accent); outline-offset: 3px; }
.text-gallery__photos { display: flex; gap: 1rem; margin: 0; padding: 0 0 0.75rem; list-style: none; overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; overscroll-behavior-x: contain; }
.text-gallery__photos:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--cms-color-accent); outline-offset: 4px; }
.text-gallery__photo { flex: 0 0 85%; scroll-snap-align: start; }
.text-gallery__figure { margin: 0; }
.text-gallery__img { display: block; width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4 / 3; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 0.5rem; background-color: var(--cms-color-accent-surface); }
.text-gallery__caption { margin-top: 0.5rem; font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--cms-color-text-subtle); }
@media (min-width: 48rem) { .text-gallery { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; } .text-gallery--photos-left .text-gallery__content { order: 2; } .text-gallery--photos-left .text-gallery__media { order: 1; } }"}

